# native/turing/origsel.pin: every input of the ORIGSEL evaluator unit, by hash (Turing-profile-ORIGSEL-v1.1).
# omc <sha256>: the seeded compiler (omega-mv seed/out/omc, built by sh seed/omega-from-seed.sh).
# unit <order> <repo> <commit> <path> <sha256>: concatenated in order, then native/turing/origsel_kappa.om,
#   native/turing/origsel.om and the caller (origselmain.om or a test). Same pins as native/orig4/orig4.pin at 85641e1e.
# tool turing-coder <commit>: the reference coders (src/turing/tc_tool.c) built from this repository at that commit.
# harness c2|c3 <commit> <path> <sha256>: the collection harness of profile d_collection_rule (C2: ORIG v2;
#   C3: branch feat/700-turing-c3-tap, OMEGA_EMPIRICAL_COVERAGE_SEED, used only if C2 starts before E).
